        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Soul Collector is back — and the harvest has just begun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Soul Collector 2 is a dark idle game where you use human souls and body parts as resources to buy new upgrades and summon creatures to conquer villages. Once you’ve unlocked enough upgrades to automate the gameplay, the game practically plays itself and you can just enjoy the view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execute human, collect soul, drop body to the pit, repeat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/e5f562e7eed71c9181e5b6f8ad650225.poster.avif?t=1787497845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/e5f562e7eed71c9181e5b6f8ad650225.webm?t=1787497845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/e5f562e7eed71c9181e5b6f8ad650225.mp4?t=1787497845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The pit will get full, so keep an eye on that!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/c1d03d93ef9e417f4f88391ad840fe91.poster.avif?t=1787497845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/c1d03d93ef9e417f4f88391ad840fe91.webm?t=1787497845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/c1d03d93ef9e417f4f88391ad840fe91.mp4?t=1787497845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every now and then you can go and poke the cage slave to collect more souls.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/7300aebf7d461828e153b372debaa806.poster.avif?t=1787497845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/7300aebf7d461828e153b372debaa806.webm?t=1787497845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/7300aebf7d461828e153b372debaa806.mp4?t=1787497845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy the chaos from a distance...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/1dfcdc0006975cf32dda26242386c225.poster.avif?t=1787497845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/1dfcdc0006975cf32dda26242386c225.webm?t=1787497845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/1dfcdc0006975cf32dda26242386c225.mp4?t=1787497845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...or check out how your skeleton warriors are doing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/518a3453ec25f1e4df0beeaff48ae1d5.poster.avif?t=1787497845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/518a3453ec25f1e4df0beeaff48ae1d5.webm?t=1787497845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962200/extras/518a3453ec25f1e4df0beeaff48ae1d5.mp4?t=1787497845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reviews from players:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;At first I was like: O_o why so violent... what a **** made this game.... and then I was like: *_* come on come little sinners.... give me your souls…&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Fun game!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Pretty fun little gem.&quot;</i></p>",
